altchi из путеводителя Tamagotchi Smart","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/00/GaogaltchiMangaPanel.png/revision/latest?cb=20220803061725"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Gaogirltchi_sprite_animation.gif","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/7/73/Gaogirltchi_sprite_animation.gif/revision/latest?cb=20210619151444","caption":"Анимированный спрайт (умный)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:GaogaltchiMakeupBag.gif","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/c1/GaogaltchiMakeupBag.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20210713024657","caption":"Игра с сумкой, полной косметики (Умно)","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/c1/GaogaltchiMakeupBag.gif/revision/latest?cb=20210713024657"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:KuromiGaoSprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/3/3f/KuromiGaoSprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20220517191017","caption":"Kuromi Гао (Умный)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:GyaorukatchiSprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/b1/GyaorukatchiSprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20220727044541","caption":"Gaorukatchi (Умный)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:FranGaltchiSprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/11/FranGaltchiSprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20241028163431","caption":"Фрэн Galtchi (Умный)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:RoseGyaoSprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/c/ce/RoseGyaoSprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20250318200117","caption":"Роуз Гяо (Умная)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:GaoFireSprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/b/bd/GaoFireSprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20220909015533","caption":"Гао Огонь (Умный)","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:MeridaGaltchiSprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/6/66/MeridaGaltchiSprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20230211045530","caption":"Мерида Galtchi (Умный)","sprite":true},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/06/0644b9134e391f8c4ee8.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamagotchiDotsSmartKeychain.PNG","caption":"Tamagotchi Брелок в виде точек"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/69/6961c59139ce2e29f457.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamagotchiDotsSmartRubber.PNG","caption":"Tamagotchi Каучуковый ремешок в горошек"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Gaogaltchi_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/7/73/Gaogaltchi_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20220817191315","caption":"Gaogaltchi sprite.png","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Gaogaltchi_MametchiMemories_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/4/4d/Gaogaltchi_MametchiMemories_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20261027161836","caption":"Gaogaltchi MametchiMemories sprite.png","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:KuromiGao.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/15/KuromiGao.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20220513174625","caption":"KuromiGao.png","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/15/KuromiGao.png/revision/latest?cb=20220513174625"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:GaorukatchiArtwork.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/00/GaorukatchiArtwork.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20221028050051","caption":"GaorukatchiArtwork.png","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/00/GaorukatchiArtwork.png/revision/latest?cb=20221028050051"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:FranGaltchi.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/51/FranGaltchi.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20220615184039","caption":"FranGaltchi.png","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/51/FranGaltchi.png/revision/latest?cb=20220615184039"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:RoseGyaoArtwork.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/07/RoseGyaoArtwork.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20221028052402","caption":"RoseGyaoArtwork.png","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/07/RoseGyaoArtwork.png/revision/latest?cb=20221028052402"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:GaoFire.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/59/GaoFire.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20221029045022","caption":"GaoFire.png","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/59/GaoFire.png/revision/latest?cb=20221029045022"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:MeridaGaltchi.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/d5/MeridaGaltchi.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20221124054138","caption":"MeridaGaltchi.png","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/d5/MeridaGaltchi.png/revision/latest?cb=20221124054138"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Gaogaltchi.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/18/Gaogaltchi.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20210619164559","caption":"Gaogaltchi.png","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/18/Gaogaltchi.png/revision/latest?cb=20210619164559"}],"related":[{"id":"tamagotchi-nano-colorful-mametchi-memories-c351a3","title":"Tamagotchi Nano Colorful: Mametchi Memories","ru":"Tamagotchi Nano Colorful: Mametchi Memories","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"},{"id":"tamagotchi-pix-174e73","title":"Tamagotchi Pix","ru":"Tamagotchi Pix","kind":"d